  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Colombia: Strengthening the Capacity of the Investigations and Indictments Unit (UIA) of the                Special Jurisdiction for Peace of Colombia</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">1) To ensure that judges and prosecutors from the Investigations and Indictments                Unit (UIA) of the Special Jurisdiction for Peace of Colombia agree on the definition of trial                conditions. 2) To ensure that UIA prosecutors know how to prepare and present charges in a structured,                legally sound and standardized manner.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="3">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Direct beneficiaries: Prosecutors from the UIA, judges and attorneys. 
Indirect                beneficiaries: Justice seekers.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project aimed to improve prosecution of cases brought to the Special                Jurisdiction for Peace.</narrative>
  </description>
